   "text": "Are there cases where something changes or doesn't go as planned? Of course. A surgery postponed for additional testing or even because a war has broken out, a patient's condition changed, a family moved. As simple as our model is, global health is also really complicated. So every surgery, wherever you are, carries risks. And we report those too. We tell you what happened. And I've seen, actually, this builds more trust in our community.",
   "timing": "words",
   "matched": 1.0,
   "lang": "en"
